  "details": "Unity Version: 2022.3.6f1\n\nBase SDK Version: 3.5.0\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nThe VRChat Base SDK using UnityEngine.Timeline, but Timeline is not included in the package's dependencies.\n\nThis causes a build failure in environments where Timeline is not installed, as there are no preprocessor directives or other measures to handle the absence of Timeline.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open Unity.\n\n2. Import the VRChat Base SDK.\n\n3. Uninstall Timeline in Package Manager if installed.",
